  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MARISMAS NACIONALES WETLANDS MANAGEMENT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will improve habitat in Marismas Nacionales, which is a Ramsar Site, an Important Bird..Area, and part of the federal system of Natural Protected Areas through its designation as a Biosphere..Reserve. It will: 1) Manage 3,037 hectares/7,501.39 acres of wetlands by implementing best practices..for wild shrimp fishing. 2) Improve water quality by implementing best practices for commercial..shrimp farming. 3) Develop two land use plans (Programas de Ordenamiento Ecolgico Local) for..uplands in the municipalities of Tecuala and Rosamorada</narrative>
  </description>
